* L45d2b2a soft-start: U501 C507 = 4.7e-06 F: tau 0.47 s, t_SS = tau ln((15.3 + 5) / 5) = 0.6586 s (eq. 5)
* L45d2b2a soft-start: U502 C508 = 4.7e-07 F: t_SS = 1.2 ms/nF = 0.564 s (eq. 1)
* L45d2b2a soft-start: U503 C521 = 1e-05 F: tau 1 s, t_SS = tau ln((12 + 5) / 5) = 1.224 s (eq. 5)
